    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Ami lets me in and the two of us hang out in her room for a few hours.",
      "zh": "Ami 让我进去，我俩在她房间里待了几个小时。"
    },
    {
      "en": "She coerces me into watching some girly anime with her and gets mad whenever I ask a question.",
      "zh": "她硬拉着我陪她看少女动画，我每问一个问题她就生气。"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "if day < 4:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "After a while, she tells me that she has plans with Maya tonight and that we can't hang out for much longer.",
      "zh": "过了一会儿，她说今晚跟 Maya 有约，我们不能再待太久了。"
    },
    {
      "en": "Despite that, we wind up watching a few more episodes until Ami's phone blows up with 'Where are you?' texts.",
      "zh": "尽管如此，我们又多看了好几集，直到 Ami 的手机被「你在哪儿？」的短信炸了。"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene black",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Misc/black.png",
      "alt": "black"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Being the exceptional legal guardian I am, I walk her to the park to meet up with Maya and company and begin a very boring trek home...",
      "zh": "作为她那尽职到无可挑剔的监护人，我把她送到公园跟 Maya 她们会合，然后踏上极其无聊的回家路……"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "$ ami_love += 1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Ami's affection has increased to [ami_love]!",
      "zh": "Ami 的好感度提升到了 [ami_love]！"
    },
