    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "else:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "After a while, the two of us begin to get hungry and decide that we should probably continue this at home.",
      "zh": "过了一阵，我俩开始饿了，决定还是回家继续。"
    },
    {
      "en": "Since Ami isn't staying at the dorm tonight, we walk back together and stop at a convenience store along the way.",
      "zh": "Ami 今晚不住宿舍，我俩便一路走回去，中途在便利店停了一下。"
    },
    {
      "en": "I get talked into buying her a disgusting amount of candy and, before I know it, we are skipping dinner and eating junk food.",
      "zh": "我被她说动，给她买了多得离谱的糖果，不知不觉连晚饭都不吃了，光啃垃圾食品。"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
