    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "But hey...At least I got to spend some quality time with my [niece].",
      "zh": "不过嘛……至少我跟我的[侄女]度过了美好的时光。"
    },
    {
      "en": "I can't ask for much more than that...",
